iative (OEDI). The registry page contains information about dataset documentation, access, and contact, for each of the OEDI Data Lake datasets.","encodingFormat":"website","isAccessibleForFree":true,"contentUrl":"https:\/\/registry.opendata.aws\/oedi-data-lake\/","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","geo":{"@type":"GeoShape","box":"-83 -180 83 180"}}},{"@type":"DataDownload","about":"This dataset contains the results of distributed PV and storage analysis described in chapter 7 of the report. The data consists of municipal-level energy and storage capacity results broken out by customer type and income class for the scenarios and years studied.","encodingFormat":"archive","isAccessibleForFree":true,"contentUrl":"https:\/\/data.openei.org\/files\/5749\/DERInvestments.zip","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","geo":{"@type":"GeoShape","box":"11.630941570195 -76.40843125 25.040093555492 -58.27008125"}}},{"@type":"DataDownload","about":"This dataset contains total annual load for the two load scenarios modeled in chapter 5 of the report. The data consists of annual totals broken out by load component as well as customer type for each year in CSV format.","encodingFormat":"archive","isAccessibleForFree":true,"contentUrl":"https:\/\/data.openei.org\/files\/5749\/LoadData.zip","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","geo":{"@type":"GeoShape","box":"11.630941570195 -76.40843125 25.040093555492 -58.27008125"}}},{"@type":"DataDownload","about":"This dataset contains the results of the climate modeling analysis described in chapter 13 of the report. The data consists of climate measurements at both the regional and municipality level over months and seasons. The data is available in both CSV and shapefile format.","encodingFormat":"archive","isAccessibleForFree":true,"contentUrl":"https:\/\/data.openei.org\/files\/5749\/ClimateData.zip","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","geo":{"@type":"GeoShape","box":"11.630941570195 -76.40843125 25.040093555492 -58.27008125"}}},{"@type":"DataDownload","about":"This dataset contains social burden analysis results, both total and per capita for a number of scenarios at the census tract level in Puerto Rico, as described in chapter 14 of the report. The data is available in both CSV and Geopackage format.","encodingFormat":"archive","isAccessibleForFree":true,"contentUrl":"https:\/\/data.openei.org\/files\/5749\/SocialBurden.zip","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","geo":{"@type":"GeoShape","box":"11.630941570195 -76.40843125 25.040093555492 -58.27008125"}}},{"@type":"DataDownload","about":"This dataset contains renewable resource and technical potential for utility scale renewable technologies across Puerto Rico described in chapter 4 of the report. The data consists of CSVs showing the technical potential and costs of renewables across Puerto Rico along with profile CSVs with the hourly production across Puerto Rico. Additionally, the dataset includes shapefiles documenting land use considerations used in the generation of the technical potential datasets.","encodingFormat":"archive","isAccessibleForFree":true,"contentUrl":"https:\/\/data.openei.org\/files\/5749\/RenewableResources.zip","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","geo":{"@type":"GeoShape","box":"11.630941570195 -76.40843125 25.040093555492 -58.27008125"}}},{"@type":"DataDownload","about":"This dataset contains hourly load for the two load scenarios modeled in chapter 5 of the report. The data consists of both hourly estimates broken out by load component as well as customer type for each year in CSV format.","encodingFormat":"archive","isAccessibleForFree":true,"contentUrl":"https:\/\/data.openei.org\/files\/5749\/LoadDataHourly.zip","spatialCoverage":{"@type":"Place","geo":{"@type":"GeoShape","box":"11.630941570195 -76.40843125 25.040093555492 -58.27008125"}}},{"@type":"DataDownload","about":"This dataset contains additional utility PV technical potential data for weather years beyond the 2018 and 2019 years used in the study.","encodingFormat":"archiv